{
  "about": "The Max title bar's Rewind and Network panels on the dev app (his library): the Rewind panel's open, Top Listens sliding in (the panel grows), SOTD replacing it, SOTD sliding out, the close; then the Network panel's open and close. In the app's own look (Press on 2026-10-19) and in Glass (the heaviest to draw: each shot sets the skin through the store and puts Press back, never a look, which his Live Theming rule would hold). Checks that each panel ends shut, nothing is left growing, and the hourglass and car end at rest.",
  "desk_test": "features/listening-time.md §9.3, features/speedtest.md §9",
  "made": "2026-10-19",
  "pass": "Each probe's expect holds. In the console file: each [perf] frames line for rewind-top, fold and net with dropped under 3 % and worst under 17 ms at the display's rate. In the strips: the panel grows from its top-left corner, the rows enter in order, a list slides in with the panel's height following it (no jump at the end), SOTD replaces Top Listens without the panel snapping, and the close leaves nothing behind.",
  "run": "node scripts/shots.mjs --list docs/ops/checks/title-panels-motion.json   (needs `npm run dev:app` running in Max, its window on screen)",
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "rewind-panel-press",
      "covers": "features/listening-time.md",
      "kind": "clip",
      "source": "dev",
      "seconds": 9,
      "steps": [
        {
          "eval": "window.__store.set('skin','press')"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1200
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ surface: document.documentElement.dataset.surface, shut: document.getElementById('rewind-panel').hidden })",
          "expect": {
            "surface": "max",
            "shut": true
          },
          "name": "rest"
        },
        {
          "reload": true
        },
        {
          "wait": 6000
        },
        {
          "click": "#rewind-open",
          "frames": 45,
          "region": "#rewind-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 800
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ open: !document.getElementById('rewind-panel').hidden, today: /^Today: [0-9]/.test(document.querySelector('[data-rt-today]').textContent) })",
          "expect": {
            "open": true,
            "today": true
          },
          "name": "open"
        },
        {
          "click": "[data-rt-part=\"top\"]",
          "frames": 45,
          "region": "#rewind-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1000
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ body: !document.querySelector('[data-rt-body]').hidden, rows: document.querySelectorAll('[data-rt-list] > li').length > 0, growing: document.getElementById('rewind-panel').classList.contains('is-growing') })",
          "expect": {
            "body": true,
            "rows": true,
            "growing": false
          },
          "name": "top listens"
        },
        {
          "hover": "[data-rt-part=\"sotd\"]"
        },
        {
          "wait": 400
        },
        {
          "click": "[data-rt-part=\"sotd\"]",
          "frames": 45,
          "region": "#rewind-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 1000
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ sotd: document.querySelector('[data-rt-part=\"sotd\"]').getAttribute('aria-pressed'), top: document.querySelector('[data-rt-part=\"top\"]').getAttribute('aria-pressed'), growing: document.getElementById('rewind-panel').classList.contains('is-growing') })",
          "expect": {
            "sotd": "true",
            "top": "false",
            "growing": false
          },
          "name": "sotd"
        },
        {
          "click": "[data-rt-part=\"sotd\"]",
          "frames": 45,
          "region": "#rewind-panel"
        },
        {
          "wait": 900
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ body: document.querySelector('[data-rt-body]').hidden, growing: document.getElementById('rewind-panel').classList.contains('is-growing') })",
          "expect": {
            "body": true,
            "growing": false
          },
          "name": "list out"
        },
        {
          "click": "#rewind-open",
          "frames": 40
        },
        {
          "wait": 800
        },
        {
          "probe": "JSON.stringify({ shut: document.getElementById('rewind-panel').hidden, angle: document.getElementById('rewind-open').style.getPropertyValue('--rewind-top-angle') })",
          "expect": {
            "shut": true,
            "angle": "/^-?\\d+deg$/"
          },
          "name": "closed"
        }
      ]
    },
